    </svg>
  </div>

  <%# 2. The situation %>
  <div class="constantia-circular-deck__slide" data-constantia-circular-deck-target="slide" hidden>
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1280 720">
      <rect width="1280" height="720" fill="white"/>
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="8" height="720" fill="#013f3a"/>
      <text x="36" y="52" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#108A63" font-weight="600">THE SITUATION</text>
      <text x="36" y="104" font-family="Georgia, 'Libre Baskerville', serif" font-size="46" font-weight="bold" fill="#013f3a">Cape Town landfills roughly 850</text>
      <text x="36" y="152" font-family="Georgia, 'Libre Baskerville', serif" font-size="46" font-weight="bold" fill="#013f3a">tonnes of organic waste, every day.</text>
      <text x="36" y="182" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#8a8d97">2018 waste characterisation study — a new study is underway, but nothing suggests the number has fallen.</text>

      <rect x="36" y="214" width="374" height="204" rx="16" fill="#f9fafb" stroke="#e8eeec" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <rect x="36" y="214" width="374" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#013f3a"/>
      <text x="64" y="262" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="34" font-weight="bold" fill="#013f3a">40%+</text>
      <text x="64" y="288" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#013f3a">of the average household bin</text>
      <text x="64" y="330" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">is organic waste — the single largest</text>
      <text x="64" y="350" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">fraction, ahead of recyclables</text>
      <text x="64" y="370" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">or general waste.</text>

      <rect x="454" y="214" width="374" height="204" rx="16" fill="#f9fafb" stroke="#e8eeec" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <rect x="454" y="214" width="374" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#FBB718"/>
      <text x="482" y="262" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="34" font-weight="bold" fill="#013f3a">30% <tspan font-size="16" fill="#8a8d97">vs 50% target</tspan></text>
      <text x="482" y="288" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#013f3a">Western Cape organics diversion, 2023</text>
      <text x="482" y="330" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">The province's 50%-by-2022 diversion</text>
      <text x="482" y="350" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">target was missed, sitting at ~30%</text>
      <text x="482" y="370" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">the following year.</text>

      <rect x="872" y="214" width="374" height="204" rx="16" fill="#f0f7f4" stroke="rgba(16,138,99,0.25)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <rect x="872" y="214" width="374" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#108A63"/>
      <text x="900" y="262" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="34" font-weight="bold" fill="#108A63">100% by 2027</text>
      <text x="900" y="288" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#013f3a">now in landfill licence conditions</text>
      <text x="900" y="330" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">A tighter target is written into landfill</text>
      <text x="900" y="350" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">licence conditions and municipal organic</text>
      <text x="900" y="370" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">waste diversion plans.</text>

      <rect x="0" y="450" width="1280" height="270" fill="#013f3a"/>
      <text x="640" y="500" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2" fill="rgba(132,203,163,0.8)" font-weight="600">WHAT'S RUNNING TODAY — AND WHAT ISN'T</text>
      <text x="213" y="558" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="32" font-weight="bold" fill="#FBB718">~1,000</text>
      <text x="213" y="588" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.68)">households across two lower-income</text>
      <text x="213" y="608" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.68)">areas, City pilot since June 2024</text>
      <line x1="426" y1="524" x2="426" y2="628" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.15)" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="640" y="558" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="32" font-weight="bold" fill="#84cba3">~14,000</text>
      <text x="640" y="588" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.68)">informal-settlement households on</text>
      <text x="640" y="608" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.68)">an ongoing weekly City service</text>
      <line x1="854" y1="524" x2="854" y2="628" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.15)" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="1067" y="558" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="32" font-weight="bold" fill="white">Zero</text>
      <text x="1067" y="588" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.68)">equivalent services in a formal</text>
      <text x="1067" y="608" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.68)">suburb, anywhere in the city</text>
      <text x="640" y="666" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" fill="white" font-weight="600">Every tonne of organics sent to landfill produces methane and eats into airspace the City is running out of.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <%# 3. The proposal + flow diagram %>
  <div class="constantia-circular-deck__slide" data-constantia-circular-deck-target="slide" hidden>
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1280 720">
      <rect width="1280" height="720" fill="white"/>
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="8" height="720" fill="#013f3a"/>
