  <%# 4. Pilot design: two channels %>
  <div class="constantia-circular-deck__slide" data-constantia-circular-deck-target="slide" hidden>
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1280 720">
      <rect width="1280" height="720" fill="#F4F4F4"/>
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="1280" height="100" fill="#013f3a"/>
      <text x="64" y="42" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="rgba(132,203,163,0.8)" font-weight="600">PILOT DESIGN</text>
      <text x="64" y="80" font-family="Georgia, 'Libre Baskerville', serif" font-size="38" font-weight="bold" fill="white">Two channels, two hubs.</text>

      <rect x="64" y="128" width="566" height="264" rx="16" fill="white"/>
      <rect x="64" y="128" width="566" height="6" rx="3" fill="#108A63"/>
      <rect x="100" y="160" width="130" height="26" rx="13" fill="#f0f7f4"/>
      <text x="165" y="177" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#108A63" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="0.4">THE ENGINE</text>
      <text x="100" y="230" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="24" font-weight="bold" fill="#013f3a">Collection</text>
      <text x="100" y="262" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">Weekly doorstep collection from ~500</text>
      <text x="100" y="284" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">pledged households, delivered to a hub</text>
      <text x="100" y="306" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">based at a community growing site.</text>
      <text x="100" y="336" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">Compost produced feeds local food</text>
      <text x="100" y="358" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">growing directly.</text>

      <rect x="650" y="128" width="566" height="264" rx="16" fill="white"/>
      <rect x="650" y="128" width="566" height="6" rx="3" fill="#FBB718"/>
      <rect x="686" y="160" width="90" height="26" rx="13" fill="rgba(251,183,24,0.14)"/>
      <text x="731" y="177" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#B98A0C" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="0.4">THE TEST</text>
      <text x="686" y="230" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="24" font-weight="bold" fill="#013f3a">Drop-off</text>
      <text x="686" y="262" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">A second in-vessel unit at a high-traffic</text>
      <text x="686" y="284" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">retail precinct (e.g. Constantia Village),</text>
      <text x="686" y="306" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">open to all residents, with a live public</text>
      <text x="686" y="328" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">dashboard: litres diverted, compost made,</text>
      <text x="686" y="350" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#525560">CO₂e avoided, households participating.</text>
      <rect x="686" y="362" width="330" height="22" rx="11" fill="#f9fafb"/>
      <text x="851" y="377" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#525560" font-weight="600">Precinct restaurants drop off free for the pilot</text>

      <rect x="0" y="418" width="1280" height="302" fill="#013f3a"/>
      <text x="64" y="466" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2" fill="rgba(132,203,163,0.8)" font-weight="600">WHY RUN BOTH</text>
      <text x="64" y="504" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="white">The City has an open question: does drop-off work for</text>
      <text x="64" y="534" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="#84cba3">household organics, or does the service need to come to the door?</text>
      <text x="64" y="568" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.62)">This pilot answers it with a controlled comparison — same suburb, same demographics, same year,</text>
      <text x="64" y="590" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.62)">collection against drop-off, independently measured. Whatever the result, the City gets the evidence</text>
      <text x="64" y="612" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.62)">it needs to design the citywide model.</text>
      <rect x="64" y="642" width="560" height="44" rx="22" fill="rgba(132,203,163,0.14)" stroke="rgba(132,203,163,0.3)" stroke-width="0.75"/>
      <text x="94" y="669" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#84cba3" font-weight="600">+ a pledge tracker registers home composters — a third, zero-cost channel</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <%# 5. Rollout timeline %>
  <div class="constantia-circular-deck__slide" data-constantia-circular-deck-target="slide" hidden>
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1280 720">
      <rect width="1280" height="720" fill="white"/>
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="8" height="720" fill="#013f3a"/>
      <text x="36" y="52" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#108A63" font-weight="600">ROLLOUT</text>
      <text x="36" y="102" font-family="Georgia, 'Libre Baskerville', serif" font-size="40" font-weight="bold" fill="#013f3a">Twelve months, five checkpoints.</text>

      <line x1="76" y1="360" x2="1204" y2="360" stroke="#e0e6e2" stroke-width="3"/>

      <circle cx="120" cy="360" r="10" fill="#013f3a"/>
      <text x="120" y="330" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#013f3a">MONTHS 0–1</text>
      <text x="120" y="404" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">Pledge campaign opens</text>
      <text x="120" y="424" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">(gooi.me + printed sheets)</text>
      <text x="120" y="444" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">Host sites signed</text>
      <text x="120" y="464" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">Caddy distribution begins</text>

      <circle cx="392" cy="360" r="10" fill="#108A63"/>
      <text x="392" y="330" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#108A63">MONTHS 1–3</text>
      <text x="392" y="404" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">Both hubs live</text>
      <text x="392" y="424" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">Collection route ramps</text>
      <text x="392" y="444" text-anchor="middle" font-family="-apple-system, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#525560">250 → 500 households</text>
